            </note>
            <note corresp="#d56-f2" n="2" xml:id="d56-f2-content">
                <p>For the report, January 31, and other documentation on the question of developing
                    the hydrogen bomb, see <ref target="#pg493">pp. 493</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d56-f3" n="3" xml:id="d56-f3-content">
                <p>For text of the President’s announcement, January 31, see footnote 1, <ref
                        target="#pg513">p. 513</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
